OL,3,GNEWSAMan in critical condition after
OL,4,Aearly morning attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is in a critical condition in
OL,7,Fhospital after being attacked in a city
OL,8,Fcentre, police have said.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police was called by
OL,11,Fparamedics shortly after 01:50 GMT
OL,12,Fafter the man, in his 20s, was
OL,13,Fassaulted in Midsummer Boulevard in
OL,14,FMilton Keynes.
OL,16,FA statement from the force said: "The
OL,17,Fvictim sustained serious injuries and
OL,18,Fremains in hospital in a critical
OL,19,Fcondition."
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
